{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜跨境白牌車問題(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-03-13-50-08TFCfC25P.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：跨境白牌車問題</p><p>本台早前揭發有「白牌車」接載內地旅客離港，警方連日發起打擊及拘捕行動。究竟跨境「白牌車」為何禁之不絕？怎樣才是長遠的治本方案？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>中港澳直通巴士聯會秘書長李少鳴</p><p>中國香港汽車會永遠榮譽會長李耀培</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:34.752940+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T01:58:24.025903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:52.377696+00:00","content_hash":"66a1ac58a8fdf82ec540eb4baa300b26c563ac92b22bffc92e6fd2cc3ba2533d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:34.752940+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}